WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.980
How do I answer this

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:03.712
when there's puppies
running all over on me?

00:00:03.712 --> 00:00:06.295
(jingle bells)

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:09.875
Hi.

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:12.875
(upbeat rock music)

00:00:15.485 --> 00:00:16.563
What are you talking about?

00:00:16.563 --> 00:00:17.950
Santa comes every year.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.570
Even the dogs are at odds about this.

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:24.570
Can't control them, they
just do what they want.

00:00:26.605 --> 00:00:30.017
Everything about the
holidays is just so much fun

00:00:30.017 --> 00:00:31.503
that I don't even know how to explain it

00:00:31.503 --> 00:00:33.931
while I'm watching these
puppies fight with each other.

00:00:33.931 --> 00:00:38.098
They're so adorable, I
can't believe they're here.

00:00:40.888 --> 00:00:44.232
I'll be happy with anything,
it's the thought that counts.

00:00:44.232 --> 00:00:45.315
Awe. Come on.

00:00:46.614 --> 00:00:48.066
It's the cutest thing ever.

00:00:48.066 --> 00:00:49.859
Look, they're too young to be trained,

00:00:49.859 --> 00:00:52.192
so this is a natural moment.

00:00:56.099 --> 00:00:58.065
All I want for Christmas is my...

00:00:58.065 --> 00:00:59.617
The first Christmas song that I ever wrote

00:00:59.617 --> 00:01:00.803
for my first Christmas album,

00:01:00.803 --> 00:01:02.146
which is called 'Merry Christmas',

00:01:02.146 --> 00:01:04.762
and there's a new animated movie

00:01:04.762 --> 00:01:08.306
about a little girl that
wants a puppy for Christmas.

00:01:08.306 --> 00:01:10.471
Ouch. This one bites.

00:01:10.471 --> 00:01:12.619
I'm just here posing and
playing with puppies,

00:01:12.619 --> 00:01:17.175
talking about other things,
but to answer your question,

00:01:17.175 --> 00:01:18.175
but, wait...

00:01:22.135 --> 00:01:24.529
Soon as I get back in the
studio after Christmas,

00:01:24.529 --> 00:01:25.878
because right now we're celebrating

00:01:25.878 --> 00:01:28.253
the fact that we have a...

00:01:28.253 --> 00:01:30.420
Look at this dog, come on.

00:01:33.846 --> 00:01:35.187
I wasn't thinking about that,

00:01:35.187 --> 00:01:36.986
I was just recording a Christmas song.

00:01:36.986 --> 00:01:38.325
Hi, puppy.

00:01:38.325 --> 00:01:40.314
That's a boring answer,
but it's the truth.

00:01:40.314 --> 00:01:42.260
Look at this, please tell
me you're getting this.

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:43.825
Adorable.

00:01:43.825 --> 00:01:45.112
Buzzfeed.

00:01:45.112 --> 00:01:46.539
- [Woman] I knew it.

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:49.122
(upbeat music)

